142	// TestSchemelessUpstreamHostAndPathDiagnosticsKept pins the redaction
143	// boundary: with legal credentials, a malformed escape that belongs to the
144	// host or base path keeps its own diagnostic and its fragment (so it is not
145	// mislabeled a password problem), while only the credentials are hidden. An
146	// '@' inside the base path stays a path character and never widens the
